---@field scopeStates? gcp.unstable.gkehub_v1alpha.ScopeFeatureStateMap Output only. Scope-specific Feature status. If this Feature does report any per-Scope status, this field may be unused. The keys indicate which Scope the state is for, in the form: `projects/{p}/locations/global/scopes/{s}` Where {p} is the project, {s} is a valid Scope in this project. {p} WILL match the Feature's project.
